---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { siteBase } from "../utils/site-base";

const base = siteBase();
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Getting here"
	description="Driving directions and final-approach map for Villa Sancti Albani in central Maine (St. Albans, ME). Don't trust Google for the last mile."
>
	<div class="content content--narrow">
		<h1>Getting here</h1>
		<p class="lede">
			The estate is in <strong>central Maine</strong>, in <strong>St. Albans, ME</strong>. Cellular coverage can be patchy on rural roads; save these
			notes offline before you leave Bangor or Augusta. The exact address is shared when your stay is confirmed.
		</p>

		<h2>From Bangor or Augusta</h2>
		<p>
			Both cities are the main commercial hubs along this corridor. From either direction, follow your map app to <strong>St. Albans</strong> using the
			details we send you, then read the <strong>Final approach</strong> below carefully. Stick to paved public roads unless you have been told
			otherwise; rural Maine navigation will sometimes suggest seasonal or private tracks.
		</p>

		<h2>Final approach — please read</h2>
		<p>
			<strong>Do not let Google route you down Bigelow Rd. out of Saint Albans.</strong> Continue on <strong>Rte. 152</strong> for
			<strong>4.1 miles</strong> past the Bigelow Rd. turn, then take a <strong>left onto Bryant Rd.</strong> It <em>is</em> a through road, even
			if Google thinks it isn&apos;t.
		</p>

		<figure class="approach-map">
			<svg
				viewBox="0 0 720 480"
				role="img"
				aria-labelledby="approach-map-title approach-map-desc"
				xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
			>
				<title id="approach-map-title">Final approach diagram</title>
				<desc id="approach-map-desc">
					From Saint Albans, do not take Bigelow Road. Continue 4.1 miles on Route 152 and take a left onto Bryant Road to reach the
					property.
				</desc>

				<defs>
					<marker id="arrow-green" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse">
						<path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="#2a3d34"></path>
					</marker>
					<marker id="arrow-red" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse">
						<path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="#9c2a1f"></path>
					</marker>
				</defs>

				<rect x="0" y="0" width="720" height="480" fill="#f3f0e8"></rect>

				<g opacity="0.18">
					{Array.from({ length: 17 }).map((_, i) => (
						<line x1={i * 45} y1="0" x2={i * 45} y2="480" stroke="#b8a57e" stroke-width="0.5"></line>
					))}
					{Array.from({ length: 11 }).map((_, i) => (
						<line x1="0" y1={i * 48} x2="720" y2={i * 48} stroke="#b8a57e" stroke-width="0.5"></line>
					))}
				</g>

				<g font-family="Cinzel, serif" font-size="11" letter-spacing="2" fill="#2c2a28">
					<text x="660" y="30" text-anchor="middle">N</text>
					<line x1="660" y1="38" x2="660" y2="68" stroke="#2c2a28" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrow-green)"></line>
				</g>

				<g stroke="#c9b896" stroke-width="14" fill="none" opacity="0.35" stroke-linecap="round">
					<path d="M 60 380 Q 180 340 240 330"></path>
					<path d="M 580 110 Q 640 200 660 270"></path>
				</g>

				<g stroke="#2c2a28" stroke-width="5" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round">
					<path d="M 60 380 L 240 330 L 360 290 L 520 230"></path>
				</g>
				<text x="160" y="350" font-family="Libre Baskerville, serif" font-size="13" fill="#2c2a28" font-weight="700">Rte. 152</text>

				<g stroke="#9c2a1f" stroke-width="4" stroke-dasharray="8 6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.85">
					<path d="M 260 322 L 280 220 L 250 130"></path>
				</g>
				<text x="190" y="180" font-family="Libre Baskerville, serif" font-size="13" fill="#9c2a1f" font-weight="700">Bigelow Rd.</text>
				<text x="190" y="200" font-family="Libre Baskerville, serif" font-size="11" fill="#9c2a1f" font-style="italic">(do not take)</text>

				<g transform="translate(265, 318)">
					<circle r="14" fill="#fff" stroke="#9c2a1f" stroke-width="3"></circle>
					<path d="M -7 -7 L 7 7 M 7 -7 L -7 7" stroke="#9c2a1f" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
				</g>

				<g stroke="#2a3d34" stroke-width="5" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round">
					<path d="M 520 230 L 540 160 L 590 100" marker-end="url(#arrow-green)"></path>
				</g>
				<text x="540" y="195" font-family="Libre Baskerville, serif" font-size="13" fill="#2a3d34" font-weight="700">Bryant Rd.</text>
				<text x="540" y="213" font-family="Libre Baskerville, serif" font-size="11" fill="#2a3d34" font-style="italic">left after 4.1 mi</text>

				<g>
					<circle cx="60" cy="380" r="9" fill="#6b5340" stroke="#f3f0e8" stroke-width="3"></circle>
					<text x="60" y="410" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Cinzel, serif" font-size="11" letter-spacing="2" fill="#2c2a28">
						SAINT ALBANS
					</text>
				</g>

				<g>
					<path d="M 590 100 L 583 88 L 597 88 Z" fill="#2a3d34" stroke="#f3f0e8" stroke-width="2"></path>
					<circle cx="590" cy="100" r="4" fill="#f3f0e8"></circle>
					<text x="590" y="75" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Cinzel, serif" font-size="11" letter-spacing="2" fill="#2a3d34" font-weight="700">
						THE ALBANI
					</text>
				</g>

				<g transform="translate(380, 308) rotate(-18)">
					<rect x="-26" y="-12" width="52" height="20" fill="#f3f0e8" stroke="#2c2a28" stroke-width="0.75" rx="2"></rect>
					<text x="0" y="2" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Libre Baskerville, serif" font-size="11" fill="#2c2a28" font-weight="700">4.1 mi</text>
				</g>

				<g transform="translate(20, 440)" font-family="Libre Baskerville, serif" font-size="10" fill="#2c2a28">
					<rect x="0" y="-12" width="14" height="3" fill="#2a3d34"></rect>
					<text x="20" y="-7">Drive this</text>
					<rect x="120" y="-12" width="14" height="3" fill="#9c2a1f"></rect>
					<text x="140" y="-7">Avoid (Bigelow Rd.)</text>
					<text x="280" y="-7" font-style="italic">Diagram, not to scale.</text>
				</g>
			</svg>
			<figcaption>
				Final approach. Stay on Rte. 152 past Bigelow Rd., then left onto Bryant Rd. after 4.1 miles. The original printable copy is also
				available as a <a href={`${base}getting-here/final-approach.pdf`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">PDF download</a>.
			</figcaption>
		</figure>

		<h2>At the property</h2>
		<ul class="list-plain">
			<li>Slow down as you near the mailbox or posted address numbers; the driveway is easy to miss at night.</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Gate</strong>: [Add your combination, keypad steps, or fob instructions here. Example: enter code at the silver keypad, wait for the tone, then
				push the gate gently.]
			</li>
			<li>Park only in the areas marked for guests [specify: gravel apron, bay beside the barn, etc.].</li>
		</ul>

		<h2>Winter and mud season</h2>
		<p>
			If you are visiting outside summer, confirm whether snow tires or AWD are advised. [Customize with your road commission, plow contractor, or steep grade
			notes.]
		</p>

		<div class="btn-row">
			<a class="btn" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=St+Albans%2C+ME" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
				Open St. Albans, ME in Google Maps
			</a>
			<a class="btn btn--ghost" href={`${base}getting-here/final-approach.pdf`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
				Download printable map (PDF)
			</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.approach-map {
		margin: var(--space-lg) 0;
	}

	.approach-map svg {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		height: auto;
		border: 1px solid var(--color-sand-warm);
		background: var(--color-bone);
	}

	.approach-map figcaption {
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: var(--color-charcoal);
		margin-top: var(--space-sm);
		font-style: italic;
	}
</style>
